s a Tsunami Information Statement for Alaska and the Canadian Arctic region.","instruction":"There is NO tsunami danger from this earthquake.  This will be the only U.S. National Tsunami Warning Center    message issued for this event unless additional information    becomes available.   The location and magnitude are based on preliminary information.   Further information will be issued by the United States    Geological Survey (earthquake.usgs.gov) or the appropriate    regional seismic network.","issueTime":"2026-09-15 17:56:33","jsonUrl":"http://www.tsunami.gov/events/PAAQ/2026/09/15/tlegq7/1/WEAK53/PAAQ.json","level":"Information","magType":"Ml","maps":{"energyMapUrl":"","travelTimeMapUrl":""},"severity":"Minor","urgency":"Unknown"},"md5":"1344547a5215ef9934893621da002bda","source":"ntwc"},{"Data":{"id":"PHEB-1-26234000","updates":1,"shockTime":"2026-08-22 16:22:36","latitude":-60.481,"longitude":-47.185,"depth":10.0,"magnitude":6.7,"placeName":"斯科舍海","agency":"PTWC","bulletinUrl":"http://www.tsunami.gov/events/PHEB/2026/08/22/26234000/1/WEPA42/WEPA42.txt","capUrl":"https://www.tsunami.gov/events/xml/PHEBCAP.xml","certainty":"Unlikely","description":"PTWC TSUNAMI INFORMATION STATEMENT - Event details: Preliminary magnitude 6.7 (Mwp) earthquake / Lat: -60.481, Lon: -47.185 at 2026-08-22T08:22:36Z","eventId":"26234000","expires":"2026-08-22 17:30:40","headline":"PTWC TSUNAMI INFORMATION STATEMENT","instruction":"N/A","issueTime":"2026-08-22 16:30:40","jsonUrl":"http://www.tsunami.gov/events/PHEB/2026/08/22/26234000/1/WEPA42/PHEB.json","level":"Information","magType":"Mwp","maps":{"energyMapUrl":"http://www.tsunami.gov/events/PHEB/2026/08/22/26234000/1/WEPA42/","travelTimeMapUrl":""},"severity":"Minor","urgency":"Unknown"},"md5":"afab3c01223bc6a85569c9581223caeb","source":"ptwc"},{"Data":{"id":"incois2026qmbb_B1","updates":1,"shockTime":"2026-08-21 02:00:00","latitude":-14.59,"longitude":-73.52,"depth":10,"magnitude":6.8,"placeName":"Central Peru","agency":"INCOIS","bulletinType":"I","description":"Based on historical earthquake and tsunami data, Tsunami Threat does not exist for India. ITEWC INCOIS will monitor sea level changes near epicentral region and report in case of tsunami threat.","detailUrl":"https://tsunami.incois.gov.in/itews/DSSProducts/OPR/incois2026qmbb/NTWC/B1/incois2026qmbb_B1_NTWC_Pub.json","eventId":"incois2026qmbb","headline":"... EARTHQUAKE BULLETIN ...","instruction":"This bulletin is being issued as advice. Only national/state/local authorities and disaster management officers have the authority to make decisions regarding the official threat and warning status in their coastal areas and any action to be taken in response.","issueTime":"2026-08-21 02:09:00","level":"Information","listUrl":"https://tsunami.incois.gov.in/itews/DSSProducts/OPR/past90days.json","ocean":"PO","topoBathy":"NIL (Located at a distnace of 162 km from coastline on Land)","updatesText":"No further bulletins will be issued by ITEWC INCOIS for this event unless additional information becomes available."},"md5":"19a0f8596cb8c64644a59b88a07fd931","source":"incois"},{"Data":{"id":"BOLETIN_INFORMATIVO_001_20260914_151809","updates":1,"shockTime":"2026-09-15 04:38:58","latitude":15.045,"longitude":-104.219,"depth":10.0,"magnitude":5.5,"placeName":"墨西哥米却肯州沿岸远海","agency":"CAT","bulletinUrl":"https://diredimoat.semar.gob.mx/cat/Boletines/BOLETIN_INFORMATIVO_001_20260914_151809.txt","capUrl":"https://diredimoat.semar.gob.mx/cat/rss/ultimo_boletin.xml","certainty":"Unlikely","description":"En base a las caracteristicas, ubicacion del sismo y a la informacion recibida, no se espera la generacion de un tsunami para las costas nacionales.","eventId":"BOLETIN_INFORMATIVO_001_20260914_151809","headline":"BOLETIN INFORMATIVO 001 20260914 151809","instruction":"NINGUNA. Este sera el unico boletin que se emita para este evento, a menos que se reciba informacion complementaria.","issueTime":"2026-09-15 05:18:09","level":"Information","senderName":"CENTRO DE ALERTA DE TSUNAMIS (CAT-SEMAR)","severity":"Minor","urgency":"Unknown"},"md5":"039489e8006dc714f078cfd6a24a2996","source":"cat_tsunami"},{"Data":{"id":"36082741600000_20260917153651","headline":"江西省吉安市遂川县气象台发布暴雨橙色预警信号","effective":"2026/09/17 15:35","description":"遂川县气象台2026年09月17日15时35分变更暴雨橙色预警信号：预计未来3小时内，草林镇、大坑乡、堆子前镇、高坪镇、泉江镇、汤湖镇、五斗江乡、衙前镇、雩田镇、左安镇的部分地区降水可达50毫米以上，并伴有短时强降水、雷电等强对流天气，请注意防范强降雨可能引发的暴雨积涝、中小河流洪水、山洪和地质灾害等次生灾害。\n\n防御指南：\n1.政府及相关部门按照职责做好防暴雨应急工作；\n2.切断有危险的室外电源，暂停户外作业；\n3.处于危险地带的单位应当停课、停业，采取专门措施保护已到校学生、幼儿和其他上班人员的安全；\n4.做好城市、农田的排涝，注意防范可能引发的山洪、滑坡、泥石流等灾害。","type":"p0002002","title":"江西省吉安市遂川县气象台发布暴雨橙色预警信号","img":"https://image.nmc.cn/assets/img/alarm/p0002002.png"},"md5":"b3f094d76e452f323b277e921ff178c3","source":"weatheralarm"},{"Data":{"id":"CD.20260916135200.000","infoTypeName":"正式测定","magnitude":3.6,"placeName":"青海海西州直辖区","shockTime":"2026-09-16 13:52:00","updateTime":"2026-09-16 13:59:53","longitude":95.63,"latitude":37.8,"depth":10.0,"createTime":"2026-09-16 13:59:53"},"md5":"868166f2233e9a14b53a1ce899e41e5b","source":"cenc"},{"Data":{"id":"kma_20260915212249_35.62_124.77","magnitude":2.9,"placeName":"전남광주 신안군 흑산도 북북서쪽 121km 해역","shockTime":"2026-09-15 20:22:49","updateTime":"2026-09-15 20:22:49","longitude":124.77,"latitude":35.62,"depth":0.0,"intensity":"Ⅰ","placename_zh":"韩国岛屿"},"md5":"851745c03a9aa2bf245396eeca62b9bd","source":"kma"},{"Data":{"id":"2021007178","infoTypeName":"지진조기경보","magnitude":5.3,"placeName":"제주 서귀포시 서남서쪽 32km 해역","shockTime":"2021-12-14 07:19:16","longitude":126.24,"latitude":33.15,"depth":0,"createTime":"2021-12-14 07:19:16","intensity":"Ⅵ","isWarn":true,"maxIntensityArea":["제주"],"maxMMI":6,"originTime":1639437556000,"phase":2,"placename_zh":"济州近海岛屿"},"md5":"d38fc772168be1d14f0a9322fd3da379","source":"kma_eew"},{"Data":{"id":"VFVO53_551","updates":1,"reportTime":"2026-09-17 14:00:00","latitude":31.9095,"longitude":130.88633333333334,"activity":"１７日１５時から１８日９時までに噴火が発生した場合には、以下の方向・距離に降灰及び小さな噴石の落下が予想されます。\n\u3000\n\u3000時刻\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000火口からの方向\u3000降灰の距離\u3000小さな噴石の距離\n\u3000１７日１５時から１８時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000６０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000３ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\u3000１７日１８時から２１時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000６０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000３ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\u3000１７日２１時から２４時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000８０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000３ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\u3000１８日００時から０３時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000９０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000５ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\u3000１８日０３時から０６時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000９０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000５ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\u3000１８日０６時から０９時まで\u3000西\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000８０ｋｍ\u3000\u3000５ｋｍ\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\n\n\u3000\n\u3000期間中に噴火が発生した場合には、以下の市町村に降灰が予想されます。\n\u3000宮崎県\u3000：小林市、えびの市\n\u3000鹿児島県：霧島市、湧水町、阿久根市、出水市、薩摩川内市、伊佐市、姶良市、さつま町、長島町\n\u3000熊本県\u3000：人吉市、錦町、水俣市、天草市","craterName":"","elevation":1421,"headline":"現在、霧島山（新燃岳）は噴火警戒レベル２（火口周辺規制）です。霧島山（新燃岳）で噴火が発生した場合には、１７日２１時から２４時までは火口から西方向に降灰が予想されます。","infoKind":"降灰予報","infoTypeName":"発表","kindCode":"VFVO53","kindName":"降灰预报（定时）","nextAdvisory":"","observation":"","plumeDirection":"","plumeHeight":0,"plumeHeightSea":0,"prevention":"噴煙が火口縁上２０００ｍまで上がった場合の火山灰及び小さな噴石の落下範囲を示しています。\n\u3000噴火発生時、小さな噴石の落下が予想される範囲内では、屋内や頑丈な屋根の下などに移動してください。","publishingOffice":"気象庁","targetTime":"2026-09-17 15:00:00","title":"火山名 霧島山（新燃岳） 降灰予報（定時）","volcanoCode":"551","volcanoName":"霧島山（新燃岳）","windTime":"","winds":[]},"md5":"206af2bc4dbc65df4580a666aefecefa","source":"va"},{"Data":{"id":"CD20260816174854","magnitude":2.1,"placeName":"河北唐山市丰南区","shockTime":"2026-08-16 17:48:54","updateTime":"2026-08-16 17:48:54","longitude":117.9,"latitude":39.36,"depth":27},"md5":"bd316dd44a3fe9e8925633cbc2d23898","source":"beijing"},{"Data":{"id":"YN20260803162519M32","magnitude":3.2,"placeName":"云南大理州洱源县","shockTime":"2026-08-03 16:25:19","updateTime":"2026-08-03 16:25: